.
.  Create a GIF file for a dex scatter plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ BOXREAC2.DAT Y X1 X2 X3 X4 X5
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
CHARACTER X ALL
LINE BLANK SOLID
XLIMITS 1 5
MAJOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 5
MINOR XTIC MARK NUMBER 0
Y1LABEL PERCENT REACTED
X1TIC MARK LABEL FORMAT ALPHA
X1TIC MARK LABEL CONTENT FEED CATALYST AGITATION TEMP CONC
XTIC OFFSET 0.5 0.5
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
DEX SCATTER PLOT Y X1 X2 X3 X4 X5
.
QUIT
